# wave-sets.vrs: wave-sets D20-D23 (Session 1, first boot). (1) ws-three killed wave by wave: each cleared line comes
# before the next wave's line, well before 120 s; all waves defeated ends it with the scoreboard (D20, D21).
# (2) ws-three left alive: wave 2 starts at 120 s, the run holds 20 tracked units for the timing span, an admin stop
# shows the scoreboard and leaves 0 tracked after the grace (D20, D22, D23).
# Needs: the dev world's ws-three (3 waves, 6 + 6 / 8 / 8 CHAR_Undead_SkeletonSoldier_Withered, Hunt 30);
# [Scoreboard] IncludeAdmins = true and [Debug] TimingLog = true; NyarDevTools (.devkill, .devgo pond: far enough from the castle that no wave centre lands in its territory); DevChatEcho; Chaos
# invulnerable (the owner keeps Chaos invulnerable; scenarios set `ToggleInvulnerable true`, a Boolean, and never false).
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 4
# 1. kill every wave
mark
chat .nyar event start ws-three
expect-log event ws-three wave 1/3 timeout=30
wait 12
chat .nyar debug here 60
expect-reply ws-three
shot full ws-wave1
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
expect-log \[DEV KILL\] n=
wait 3
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
expect-log event ws-three wave 1 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event ws-three wave 2/3 timeout=20
wait 12
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
wait 3
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
expect-log event ws-three wave 2 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event ws-three wave 3/3 timeout=20
wait 12
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
wait 3
chat .devkill -1584807109 50
expect-log event ws-three wave 3 cleared timeout=20
expect-log event ws-three ended: all waves defeated \(3 of 3 waves\) timeout=20
expect-log event ws-three scoreboard: 1 players, 28 kills, 0 deaths
expect-chat scoreboard: 1. Chaos 28 kills timeout=20
shot full ws-scoreboard
wait 35
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0
# 2. leave the waves alive: wave 2 at 120 s, then the timing span and an admin stop
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
mark
chat .nyar event start ws-three
expect-log event ws-three wave 1/3 timeout=30
expect-no-log event ws-three wave 2/3 timeout=105
expect-log event ws-three wave 2/3 timeout=30
wait 690
chat .nyar debug here 60
expect-reply ws-three
shot full ws-alive
chat .nyar event stop ws-three
expect-log event ws-three stopped
expect-log event ws-three scoreboard: 0 players, 0 kills, 0 deaths
expect-chat scoreboard: no player scored timeout=20
shot full ws-stop
wait 40
chat .nyar status
expect-reply tracked units: 0
